# The mapping wizard from the controller alone (bugs.md LUI.6): one SDL has
# no mapping for, opened from the keys, then the pad: A, B and X given; Y
# skipped by A held, gone back to by X held, given; the rest given but the
# sticks' four ways, skipped by A held: kept. Then again, cancelled by B
# held, its letting go after leaving Settings as it is.
pad attach raw
wait 1.5
expect home
find Settings
key Return
wait 0.5
find Controller
key Return
wait 0.5
find Layout
find Map this controller...
key Return
wait 0.3
expect padwizard
wait 1.5
pad button 0 down
wait 0.15
pad button 0 up
wait 0.3
pad button 1 down
wait 0.15
pad button 1 up
wait 0.3
pad button 2 down
wait 0.15
pad button 2 up
wait 0.3
# Y skipped by A held, then X held: back to Y, given.
pad button 0 down
wait 1.3
pad button 0 up
wait 0.3
pad button 2 down
wait 1.3
pad button 2 up
wait 0.3
pad button 3 down
wait 0.15
pad button 3 up
wait 0.3
# The shoulders, triggers, middle buttons and sticks' clicks; the d-pad.
pad button 4 down
wait 0.15
pad button 4 up
wait 0.3
pad button 5 down
wait 0.15
pad button 5 up
wait 0.3
pad button 6 down
wait 0.15
pad button 6 up
wait 0.3
pad button 7 down
wait 0.15
pad button 7 up
wait 0.3
pad button 8 down
wait 0.15
pad button 8 up
wait 0.3
pad button 9 down
wait 0.15
pad button 9 up
wait 0.3
pad button 10 down
wait 0.15
pad button 10 up
wait 0.3
pad button 11 down
wait 0.15
pad button 11 up
wait 0.3
pad button 12 down
wait 0.15
pad button 12 up
wait 0.3
pad hat 0 1
wait 0.15
pad hat 0 0
wait 0.3
pad hat 0 4
wait 0.15
pad hat 0 0
wait 0.3
pad hat 0 8
wait 0.15
pad hat 0 0
wait 0.3
pad hat 0 2
wait 0.15
pad hat 0 0
wait 0.3
# The sticks' four ways the raw pad has none of here: A held each time.
pad button 0 down
wait 1.3
pad button 0 up
wait 0.3
pad button 0 down
wait 1.3
pad button 0 up
wait 0.3
pad button 0 down
wait 1.3
pad button 0 up
wait 0.3
pad button 0 down
wait 1.3
pad button 0 up
wait 0.3
expect settings Controller
# Again, cancelled from the pad: B held once A and B are given.
find Map this controller...
key Return
wait 0.3
expect padwizard
wait 1.5
pad button 0 down
wait 0.15
pad button 0 up
wait 0.3
pad button 1 down
wait 0.15
pad button 1 up
wait 0.3
pad button 1 down
wait 1.3
expect settings Controller
pad button 1 up
wait 0.4
expect settings Controller
quit
